[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:139. Is That You, John]
[00:00.080]Lesson 139. | 第139课。
[00:03.170]Is that you, John? | 是你吗，约翰？
[00:05.470]Yes, speaking. | 是的，请说。
[00:07.240]Tell Mary we shall be late for dinner this evening. | 告诉玛丽，我们今晚会迟到吃晚餐。
[00:10.895]I'm afraid I don't understand. | 恐怕我不明白。
[00:13.720]Hasn't Mary told you? | 玛丽没告诉你吗？
[00:15.730]She invited Betty and me to dinner this evening. | 她今晚邀请贝蒂和我共进晚餐。
[00:19.370]I said I would be at your house at 6 o'clock. | 我说我会在六点钟到你家。
[00:23.035]But the boss wants me to do some extra work. | 但是老板要我做一些额外的工作。
[00:26.510]I'll have to stay at the office. | 我必须留在办公室。
[00:29.550]I don't know when I shall finish. | 我不知道什么时候能完成。
[00:32.425]Oh, and by the way, | 哦，顺便说一下，
[00:34.905]my wife wants to know if Mary needs any help. | 我妻子想知道玛丽是否需要任何帮助。
[00:39.040]I don't know what you're talking about. | 我不知道你在说什么。
[00:42.455]That is John Smith, isn't it? | 是约翰·史密斯，不是吗？
[00:44.735]Yes, I'm John Smith. | 是的，我是约翰·史密斯。
[00:47.175]You are John Smith the engineer, aren't you? | 你是工程师约翰·史密斯，不是吗？
[00:50.840]That's right. | 对的。
[00:52.315]You work for the Overseas Engineering Company, don't you? | 你在海外工程公司工作，不是吗？
[00:56.445]No, I don't. | 不，我不是。
[00:57.845]I'm John Smith the telephone engineer. | 我是电话工程师约翰·史密斯。
[01:01.065]And I'm repairing your telephone line. | 我正在修理你的电话线。